title: Through the Looking Glass
text: Step through the glass, and everything on the other side happens backwards.
trick: a teleporter pair carries the beam through a wall; on the far side it must retrace the mirror image of its route and come home to the laser's reflection
motif: a looking glass: a full wall down the middle with a mirror-symmetric staircase either side
ink: 4
expect: depth>=7
